.\" A sample mdoc page for rs-rich-ext's document tests.
.Dd October 1, 2026
.Dt CATALOG 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm catalog
.Nd concatenate and number files
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl bn
.Op Fl o Ar output
.Op Ar
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility reads each
.Ar file
in turn and writes it to the standard output.
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl b
Number the non-blank lines.
.It Fl o Ar output
Write to
.Ar output
instead of
.Dq standard output .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ catalog -n notes.txt
.Ed
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cat 1 ,
.Xr nl 1
